<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Hyseq at $14 -- top of range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Hyseq at $14 -- top of range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			    Hyseq Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $14</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $12 - $14</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in Hyseq Inc were raised to three million shares from 2.75 million shares previously.</p>
